WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,600
Why didn't God give me such a face and body?

2
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:04,560
If I had a face and body like this

3
00:00:04,560 --> 00:00:06,680
I went directly to the Hundred Horse Club to be a young master.

4
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:09,300
No need to move goods anymore, right, right, right?

5
00:00:09,300 --> 00:00:10,740
Your hair should be cut

6
00:00:10,740 --> 00:00:13,020
I would definitely look more handsome if I trimmed my hair.

7
00:00:13,020 --> 00:00:14,740
I'm actually only 28 years old this year

8
00:00:14,740 --> 00:00:15,700
I've had my hair for so long

9
00:00:15,700 --> 00:00:17,700
Just to make myself look more honest

10
00:00:17,700 --> 00:00:19,100
If I cut this hair

11
00:00:19,100 --> 00:00:20,860
When I got back there, everyone thought I was young.

12
00:00:20,860 --> 00:00:22,500
It feels like there is no way to convince the public

13
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:25,300
And those people feel more at ease with me sincerely.

14
00:00:25,300 --> 00:00:26,340
How much

15
00:00:27,340 --> 00:00:32,020
The total is 128 sir

16
00:00:32,020 --> 00:00:33,060
Can we discuss this?

17
00:00:33,060 --> 00:00:34,020
That's it

18
00:00:34,020 --> 00:00:35,780
I think your body looks very much like a model

19
00:00:35,780 --> 00:00:37,180
and very suitable

20
00:00:37,180 --> 00:00:38,540
We are advertising here

21
00:00:38,540 --> 00:00:40,580
I want to put up some big posters outside.

22
00:00:40,580 --> 00:00:42,180
Can we take some photos for you?

23
00:00:42,180 --> 00:00:45,380
If you want to be a model and put it outside, you can rest assured that we will pay you.

24
00:00:45,380 --> 00:00:47,420
And this set of clothes can be given to you for free

25
00:00:47,420 --> 00:00:48,420
How much to give

26
00:00:48,420 --> 00:00:50,500
How much do you think is suitable for the store manager?

27
00:00:50,500 --> 00:00:52,060
You're being a bit of a bully.

28
00:00:52,060 --> 00:00:53,660
