29
00:00:53,660 --> 00:00:55,060
How does he know how much it costs?

30
00:00:55,060 --> 00:00:56,100
Just tell me how much it will cost.

31
00:00:56,100 --> 00:00:58,460
We just took four or five photos and changed some clothes.

32
00:00:58,460 --> 00:01:00,140
I'll give you 800 yuan and you can dial it.
